Heroes
======

A small compiled language, designed so that every plausible mistake is a compile error. The whole language is one document: see the spec (spec/heroes-spec.md).

Why it exists
-------------

  * a model writes code that looks right and is wrong
  * the compiler is the only reader that never gets tired
  * heroes check is the whole review

  1. read the spec
  2. write a program
  3. let the compiler disagree

  | The language is finished for v1 when it can compile itself.

------------------------------------------------------------

What it refuses
---------------

    x = 5
    x = 6        # shadowing is a compile error

Nothing above is a suggestion; each line is refused by name.
